 "remarks": "Well maintained 4-bedroom, 2-bath raised ranch, ideally situated on a quiet cul-de-sac just minutes from downtown New Canaan, schools, and much more! Offering a wonderful combination of comfort, location, and future potential, this home features a spacious, functional layout and a fantastic backyard perfect for entertaining, outdoor play, or simply enjoying the peaceful setting. Recent updates include a freshly painted interior, new light fixtures, door hardware, and refinished hardwood floors. Even better, all of the major improvements have already been completed, including a newer roof, gutters, siding, windows, 200-amp electrical service, water heater, and A/C compressor.With its extensive recent improvements and thoughtful updates throughout, this home is truly move-in ready and ready to welcome its next owners.",
